The '''Devil Room''' pool is the pool of items that can be found in the {{R|Devil Room}} and can be given from [[Beggar|Hell Games]]. All items can be bought for some number of Red [[Heart container]]s (In the case of the Devil Room), {{dlc|r+}} or via damaging Sacrifice Spikes. If Isaac has no Red Heart containers, items can be bought for three {{E|Soul Heart}}s / {{E|Black Heart}}s. {{dlc|r}} Occasionally, items may cost Soul Hearts even if Isaac still has Red Hearts.

Any items outside of the Devil Room item pool will have a price of 1 Red Heart or 3 Soul Hearts/Black Hearts. This can be caused either by obtaining {{i|Chaos}} or exhausting the item pool, making {{i|Breakfast}} appear. {{dlc+|r}} The exceptions to this are items that cost 30 cents in Angel Shops from {{i|The Stairway}}, and {{i|R Key}}, which cost 2 Red Hearts, 1 Red Heart and 2 Soul Hearts, or 3 Soul Hearts.{{dlc-}}

